Making homemade waffle cones or chocolate waffle cones is really easy. You can use a SUPER cheap waffle cone iron available on Amazon for $22CAD or if you make a lot of them, get a cool wafle press like me. 
The batter is the same, the temperature etc is the same and I show you how to do everything here in this video.  

